# The sdist must not carry files this project has no licence to redistribute.
#
# Almost everything is taken from git by setuptools-scm, so exclusions have to be
# stated here. `page.html` (Howard Grubb's calculator page) and the factors
# workbook are third-party artefacts with a byline and no licence grant: they stay
# in the repository as verification inputs, pinned by hash in
# data/source_sha256.txt, and `make fetch` re-downloads them, but they do not
# belong inside a tarball whose metadata says MIT.
exclude page.html
exclude MLDRRoadFactors2025.xlsm
